# The list with art with the card's own placeholder for GBA games
# (/torii/art/box-gba.bin, which `just art-scrape` makes from an official
# box; a test picture stands in for it): a game without art shows it in
# place of the kernel's placeholder box, once the cursor rests.
#! settings 31=1
#! sd-file /torii/art/box-gba.bin 0 tests/shots/data/art-night.bin
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:RIGHT -k @12:-
-k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "nav: page gba ready"
-w "box art: cover"
-s @2:gba.png
-k @6:DOWN -k @10:-
-s @14:next.png
